# Email agent isolation

When files under `app/email_agent/` or `app/email_app/` are in context:
- ONLY edit `app/email_agent/**` and `app/email_app/**`
- Do NOT modify voice code: `app/agent/**`, `app/livekit_app/**`, `app/twilio_app/**`, `app/voice/**`
- Shared LLM import from `app.agent.llm` is OK to *use*, not to *change*, unless explicitly asked
- Wiring `email_router` in `app/main.py` / SES keys in `app/config.py` is allowed when adding email features
